{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"El autor (The Motive)","Álvaro (Javier Gutiérrez) se separa de su mujer, Amanda (María León), una exultante escritora de best‐sellers, y decide afrontar su sueño: escribir una gran novela. Pero es incapaz; no tiene talento ni imaginación... Guiado por su profesor de escritura (Antonio de la Torre), indaga en los pilares de la novela, hasta que un día descubre que la ficción se escribe con la realidad. Álvaro comienza a manipular a sus vecinos y amistades para crear una historia, una historia real que supera a la ficción.... Adaptación de \"El móvil\", primera novela de Javier Cercas, publicada en 1987. (A man obsessed with the idea of writing \"high literature\" starts to cause conflicts around him to write about it.)",[4,5,6,7,8],"low rank employment","retirement","wealth","abuse","crime",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":16,"filmType":20,"directors":21,"genre":42,"media":46,"synopsis":49,"production":52,"characters":58,"roles":89,"awards":122,"tags":3},"Film","ES2017_030","es2017-030-el-autor",{"native":14,"english":15},"El autor","The Motive",{"type":17,"date":18,"year":19},"Theatrical release","2017-11-17",2017,"Fiction film",[22],{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":26,"gender":27,"nationality":28,"awards":29},"Manuel Martín Cuenca","manuel-martin-cuenca",1964,0,"Male identifying","Spain",[30,39],{"film":31,"year":35,"award":36,"category":37,"result":38},{"slug":32,"title":33},"es2021-052-la-hija",{"native":34},"La hija",2021,"Premios Goya","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":40,"year":19,"award":36,"category":37,"result":38},{"slug":12,"title":41},{"native":14},[43,44,45],"Comedy","Drama","Crime",{"posterUrl":47,"trailerUrl":48},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5451244/mediaviewer/rm2499328/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5451244/?ref_=nv_sr_srsg_0_tt_8_nm_0_in_0_q_El%2520autor",{"native":50,"english":51},"Álvaro (Javier G